flowchart TD
    COMPOSE["compose message (client-id UUID)"] --> OPT["optimistic insert -> SSOT status Sending (Ch 72)"]
    OPT --> OUTBOX["enqueue outbox (survives death/offline, Ch 31)"]
    OUTBOX --> SEND["send with client-id idempotency key (Ch 15) over WebSocket/REST"]
    SEND --> CONFIRM["server assigns sequence -> SSOT status Sent + server-seq"]
    WS["WebSocket foreground (Ch 63)"] --> MERGE["idempotent SSOT merge: dedup client-id/server-seq, order by seq"]
    FCMPUSH["FCM background (Ch 49)"] --> CATCHUP["REST catch-up from last seq (Ch 32)"]
    CATCHUP --> MERGE
    WS --> MERGE
    RECONNECT["reconnect/open"] --> CATCHUP
    MERGE --> SSOT["Room SSOT (Ch 3) - UI observes (Ch 6)"]
    SSOT --> RECEIPTS["delivery/read receipts synced (Ch 32)"]
    SSOT --> PAGING["history paging (Ch 13)"]
    SERVER["server = source of truth + fan-out + authz (Ch 23)"] -.-> MERGE
    SERVER -.->|per-device cursors converge| SSOT
